---
// src/components/AboutSection.astro
---

<section class="about-preview" style="width: min(100% - 2rem, 860px); margin: 0 auto 3rem; padding: 1.5rem 0;">
  <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); color: var(--maroon); font-weight: 500; font-size: 1.5rem; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
    About the Hub
  </h2>
  <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1rem; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <p style="color: var(--muted); text-align: center; line-height: 1.8;">
      The Aloysian Clubs Hub connects students with the vibrant club ecosystem at 
      St Aloysius (Deemed to be University). Founded in 1880, our Jesuit institution 
      has nurtured generations of students to <strong>Shine to Enkindle</strong>.
    </p>
    <p style="color: var(--muted); text-align: center; line-height: 1.8;">
      Discover clubs across Cultural, Technical, Literary, Sports, Social Service, 
      and Arts & Media categories. Find your community, build connections, and 
      make your mark at Aloysius.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
